# Gnosis mainnet (100) production profile — copy to apps/server/.env.local (gitignored).
# NO SECRETS in git. Fill keys locally; never commit .env.local.
#
# HARD STOP: deployments/gnosis.json (2026-10-12) is dry-run-only with MockItems.
# The server will NOT auto-fill LOK_* addresses from that file (dry-run-only).
# Do not set LOK_ALLOW_DRY_RUN_DEPLOY=1 on a production host.
# Wait for an official DeployChiado + real Items.sol deploy JSON. See docs/gnosis-launch.md.

NETWORK=gnosis
# LOK_NETWORK=gnosis   # alias

# --- Process / data ---
PORT=8787
# LOK_DATA_DIR=./data
# AUTH_ORIGINS=https://legendofkek.com,https://www.legendofkek.com
# AUTH_TRUST_PROXY=1

# --- Profile defaults (override only if needed) ---
# LOK_CHAIN_ID=100
# LOK_CHAIN_RPC=https://rpc.gnosischain.com
# LOK_CHAIN_RPC_URLS=https://rpc.gnosischain.com,https://gnosis-rpc.publicnode.com,https://rpc.ankr.com/gnosis
# LOK_PUBLIC_RPC=https://rpc.gnosischain.com
# LOK_CONFIRMATIONS=2
# LOK_EXPLORER=https://gnosisscan.io
# LOK_BLOCKSCOUT=https://gnosis.blockscout.com
# LOK_DEPLOY_JSON=../../deployments/gnosis.json
# LOK_DEPLOY_BLOCK=   # REQUIRED after official deploy (watcher backfill start)

# --- Ops ---
# LOK_WATCHER_LAG_ALERT_BLOCKS=50
# Probes (same PORT as WS): GET /health  GET /ready  GET /status
# Backup: LOK_DATA_DIR=./data BACKUP_ROOT=./backups ./scripts/backup-data-dir.sh

# --- Contract addresses (blank → load from LOK_DEPLOY_JSON after official deploy) ---
# LOK_NFT=
# LOK_FACTORY=
# LOK_AH_ESCROW=
# LOK_CHECKPOINT=
# LOK_RULESETS=
# LOK_ITEMS=   # real Items.sol only — never MockItems

# --- Server keys (EOAs; distinct from Safe admin + fee recipient) ---
# LISTING_ROLE for openAsk/cancelAsk — fund minimal xDAI; sweep after ops
LOK_LISTING_KEY=
# Optional owner/admin key — not used for listing when AhEscrow is set
# LOK_OWNER_KEY=

# --- Never on mainnet ---
# LOK_DEV_FAUCET=
# LOK_DEV_SERVER_MINT=
